# A panic flushes stdout before it aborts
# (issues/fixed/panic-loses-buffered-stdout-when-piped.md). The harness runs
# the program with stdout on a pipe, where C stdio buffers fully and `abort()`
# used to discard the buffer: before the fix only the panic message (stderr)
# reached the log and the program's own line was lost.
stdout_keep_match=line printed before the panic|boom from the fixture
timeout=600
